        "markdown": "\n\n**1. Decathlon JOGFLOW 100 — ₹1,299–₹1,599 ⭐ Best overall budget pick**  \nDaily **3–5 km running/walking** ke liye meri first choice. Grip aur cushioning ka balance achha hai.\n\n**2. Decathlon JOGFLOW 190.1 — ~₹2,499 ⭐ If you can spend more**  \n₹2,500 ke around better cushioning chahiye toh ye stronger option hai. [urbanstylefootwear.com](https://urbanstylefootwear.com/best-running-shoes-under-3000-india/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**3. Reebok Flylite Rushrun — ~₹1,449**  \nWomen ke liye budget mein achha lightweight option.\n\n**4. Decathlon Run 50 — ₹999**  \nAgar budget bachana hai aur occasional jogging karni hai, kaafi sensible choice.\n\n**5. Campus Strut — ~₹1,199**  \nBasic daily jogging/walking ke liye affordable alternative.\n\nEk important point: **ASICS Jolt, Puma Skyrocket, Adidas Duramo/Nike Revolution** jaise models sale mein ₹3,000 ke aas-paas mil sakte hain, lekin price/size availability frequently change hoti hai. Current Adidas catalogue mein bhi ₹3,000 ke neeche kaafi running shoes listed hain. [www.adidas.co.in](https://www.adidas.co.in/shoes_under_3000-running-trainers?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Agar mujhe ₹3,000 mein ek hi pair choose karna ho:**  \n👉 **JOGFLOW 100** for ≤5 km regular runs.  \n👉 **JOGFLOW 190.1** if you want more cushioning and can spend ~₹2,500.\n\nAap **male/female, weight, daily kitne km run karte ho (3/5/10 km), aur road ya treadmill** bata do, main aapke liye **exact 2–3 best options + current price** shortlist kar deta hoon.",
